35,2,1,talk,Ryuji,,"The tally shows two people use it eleven times, others four. Invoices show 68k yen paid.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Jonathan,,The last awkward talk was across desks. Unplanned talk is now only by the printer.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,May,,"Lunch takes 25 minutes. Facilities had 11 callouts for equipment rooms, none for the store.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Shunichi,,"Quotes are 141k for meeting space, 96k for kitchen. Invoices confirm 68k spent.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Servas,,The wall is thin plasterboard. Three keyboards have crumbs. The mess is real.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Ryuji,,"@Shunichi, 68k is a lot for nine bookings. We are overpaying for little use.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Jonathan,,"@Ryuji, if we have a proper space, maybe we won't need to hide conversations.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,May,,"@Servas, 11 callouts for equipment? That's a lot of maintenance for a room we barely use.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Shunichi,,"@May, 96k for a kitchen is cheaper than the meeting space. But is it worth it?","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Servas,,"@Jonathan, the wall is too thin for privacy. We need a different solution.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Ryuji,,"The usage is skewed. We need a system, not just a room.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Jonathan,,A meeting space could help with the awkward conversations.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,May,,A kitchen would save us 25 minutes a day. That's significant.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Shunichi,,The meeting space is more expensive. The kitchen is cheaper but less useful for work.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Servas,,"A quiet room might be best, but the wall is the problem.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,Ryuji,,I think we need a meeting space to formalize usage.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,Jonathan,,I agree. A meeting space would help with communication.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,May,,I prefer the kitchen. It saves time and is cheaper.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,4,talk,Shunichi,,"I am leaning towards the meeting space, but the cost is high.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,2,4,talk,Servas,,I am open to any option that solves the noise and mess.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
